/// The literals a project-specific message leaves behind. The list is proven non-vacuous
/// below against the message it replaced, because a guard that matches nothing passes
/// every run without ever having looked.
/// Every step [#publish] runs is asserted in isolation above; this asserts the order it runs
/// them in, which nothing else does. `-dry-run` is the one option whose entire purpose is to
/// not upload, and hoisting the bundle above [#validate] or dropping the early return would
/// ship green and deploy against an immutable Central version.
///
